# The other side. It HAS a responsible-actor class, but it does NOT put Person
# or Organisation under it: both hang straight off the top. The mapping below
# carries ResponsibleActor across, so the two hierarchies can be compared there
# and they disagree.
@prefix hqdm: <http://hqdm.example/> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
hqdm:Person           a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf hqdm:Thing .
hqdm:Organisation     a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf hqdm:Thing .
hqdm:ResponsibleActor a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf hqdm:Thing .
hqdm:Thing            a owl:Class .
hqdm:Activity         a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf hqdm:Thing .
